From: Platina Linux contributors
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: platina: connect rear DW9714 lens

Stock camera_config.xml selects platina_dw9714_sunny/ofilm for IMX363.
Both actuator descriptors use 8-bit address 0x18 (7-bit 0x0c).
Reuse the existing board actuator regulator (TLMM50, 3.6V) and the
upstream DW9714 driver. No flash, auxiliary camera or arbitrary probing.

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm660-xiaomi-platina.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm660-xiaomi-platina.dts
@@ -332,8 +332,15 @@
 &cci_i2c0 {
 	status = "okay";
 
+	cam_rear_focus: lens@c {
+		compatible = "dongwoon,dw9714";
+		reg = <0x0c>;
+		vcc-supply = <&cam_actuator_rear_vreg>;
+	};
+
 	camera@10 {
 		compatible = "sony,imx363";
+		lens-focus = <&cam_rear_focus>;
 		reg = <0x10>;
 		reset-gpios = <&tlmm 46 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>;
 		pinctrl-names = "default";
